    "end_sec": 48.46,
    "start_time": "00:40.520",
    "end_time": "00:48.460",
    "duration_sec": 7.94,
    "text": "Helping me fulfill this honor and privilege is Chang, executive chef of the Blue Elephant, one of London's top Thai restaurants. Morning. Chang, good morning. How are you?",
