    ],
    "start_sec": 140.37,
    "end_sec": 140.7,
    "start_time": "02:20.370",
    "end_time": "02:20.700",
    "duration_sec": 0.33,
    "text": "Me too, me too, you know?",
    "word_start_index": 427,
    "word_end_index": 432
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0047",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_1",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_0"
    ],
    "start_sec": 141.62,
    "end_sec": 148.0,
    "start_time": "02:21.620",
    "end_time": "02:28.000",
    "duration_sec": 6.38,
    "text": "Those prawns smell amazing. My pad Thai is made sweet and sour with fish sauce, salt, and sugar.",
    "word_start_index": 433,
    "word_end_index": 450
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0048",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_1",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_0"
    ],
    "start_sec": 150.94,
    "end_sec": 153.92,
    "start_time": "02:30.940",
    "end_time": "02:33.920",
    "duration_sec": 2.98,
    "text": "Turn up the gas. And the tamarind paste.",
    "word_start_index": 451,
    "word_end_index": 458
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0049",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_1",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_0"
    ],
    "start_sec": 156.82,
    "end_sec": 161.26,
    "start_time": "02:36.820",
    "end_time": "02:41.260",
    "duration_sec": 4.44,
    "text": "A beaten egg is cooked in the wok and then added with the noodles and bean sprouts to the sauce.",
    "word_start_index": 459,
    "word_end_index": 478
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0050",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_1",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_0"
    ],
    "start_sec": 162.78,
    "end_sec": 164.46,
    "start_time": "02:42.780",
    "end_time": "02:44.460",
    "duration_sec": 1.68,
    "text": "I hope they're gonna be happy with this, you know that?",
    "word_start_index": 479,
    "word_end_index": 489
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0051",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_2",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_1"
    ],
    "start_sec": 164.48,
    "end_sec": 166.04,
    "start_time": "02:44.480",
    "end_time": "02:46.040",
    "duration_sec": 1.56,
    "text": "I think the monk will be happy.",
    "word_start_index": 490,
    "word_end_index": 496
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0052",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_1",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_0"
    ],
    "start_sec": 167.24,
    "end_sec": 175.96,
    "start_time": "02:47.240",
    "end_time": "02:55.960",
    "duration_sec": 8.72,
    "text": "Prawns and fresh coriander finish the pad Thai. But what will Chang think of my quick and easy version of this classic? And then some peanuts around the outside. Happy? Oh, no.",
    "word_start_index": 497,
    "word_end_index": 528
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0053",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_2",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_1"
    ],
    "start_sec": 175.98,
    "end_sec": 176.78,
    "start_time": "02:55.980",
    "end_time": "02:56.780",
    "duration_sec": 0.8,
    "text": "But I have to taste.",
    "word_start_index": 529,
    "word_end_index": 533
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0054",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_1",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_0"
    ],
    "start_sec": 177.3,
    "end_sec": 178.24,
    "start_time": "02:57.300",
    "end_time": "02:58.240",
    "duration_sec": 0.94,
    "text": "Yeah, please. I'd like to-",
    "word_start_index": 534,
    "word_end_index": 538
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0055",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_2",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_1"
    ],
    "start_sec": 178.26,
    "end_sec": 180.02,
    "start_time": "02:58.260",
    "end_time": "03:00.020",
    "duration_sec": 1.76,
    "text": "Before you go call pad Thai, I have to taste it first.",
    "word_start_index": 539,
    "word_end_index": 550
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0056",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_2",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_1"
    ],
    "start_sec": 187.19,
    "end_sec": 188.82,
    "start_time": "03:07.190",
    "end_time": "03:08.820",
    "duration_sec": 1.63,
    "text": "What you want to know from me? Ask me.",
    "word_start_index": 551,
    "word_end_index": 559
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0057",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_1",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_0"
    ],
    "start_sec": 189.38,
    "end_sec": 190.62,
    "start_time": "03:09.380",
    "end_time": "03:10.620",
    "duration_sec": 1.24,
    "text": "Well, uh, uh, how is it?",
    "word_start_index": 560,
    "word_end_index": 565
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0058",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_2",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_1"
    ],
    "start_sec": 191.4,
    "end_sec": 191.56,
    "start_time": "03:11.400",
    "end_time": "03:11.560",
    "duration_sec": 0.16,
    "text": "Hmm?",
    "word_start_index": 566,
    "word_end_index": 566
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0059",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_1",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_0"
    ],
    "start_sec": 192.26,
    "end_sec": 193.3,
    "start_time": "03:12.260",
    "end_time": "03:13.300",
    "duration_sec": 1.04,
    "text": "Oh, no. Look at that face.",
    "word_start_index": 567,
    "word_end_index": 572
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0060",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_2",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_1"
    ],
    "start_sec": 194.1,
    "end_sec": 195.36,
    "start_time": "03:14.100",
    "end_time": "03:15.360",
    "duration_sec": 1.26,
    "text": "This is not pad Thai at all.",
    "word_start_index": 573,
    "word_end_index": 579
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0061",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_1",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_0"
    ],
    "start_sec": 195.6,
    "end_sec": 196.18,
    "start_time": "03:15.600",
    "end_time": "03:16.180",
    "duration_sec": 0.58,
    "text": "This is not pad Thai?",
    "word_start_index": 580,
    "word_end_index": 584
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0062",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_2",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_1"
    ],
    "start_sec": 196.86,
    "end_sec": 197.0,
    "start_time": "03:16.860",
    "end_time": "03:17.000",
    "duration_sec": 0.14,
    "text": "No.",
    "word_start_index": 585,
    "word_end_index": 585
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0063",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_1",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_0"
    ],
    "start_sec": 197.14,
    "end_sec": 197.15,
    "start_time": "03:17.140",
    "end_time": "03:17.150",
    "duration_sec": 0.01,
    "text": "No.",
    "word_start_index": 586,
    "word_end_index": 586
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0064",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_2",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_1"
    ],
    "start_sec": 197.16,
    "end_sec": 199.46,
    "start_time": "03:17.160",
    "end_time": "03:19.460",
    "duration_sec": 2.3,
    "text": "Pad Thai have to be sweet, sour, and salty.",
    "word_start_index": 587,
    "word_end_index": 595
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0065",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_1",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_0"
    ],
    "start_sec": 202.7,
    "end_sec": 206.14,
    "start_time": "03:22.700",
    "end_time": "03:26.140",
    "duration_sec": 3.44,
    "text": "I think that doesn't taste too bad. It's not perfect.",
    "word_start_index": 596,
    "word_end_index": 605
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0066",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_2",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_1"
    ],
    "start_sec": 206.16,
    "end_sec": 207.66,
    "start_time": "03:26.160",
    "end_time": "03:27.660",
    "duration_sec": 1.5,
    "text": "For you, but not for me.",
    "word_start_index": 606,
    "word_end_index": 611
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0067",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_1",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_0"
    ],
    "start_sec": 209.0,
    "end_sec": 211.4,
    "start_time": "03:29.000",
    "end_time": "03:31.400",
    "duration_sec": 2.4,
    "text": "You're a tough cookie. I'm gonna keep an eye on the monks-",
    "word_start_index": 612,
    "word_end_index": 623
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0068",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_2",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_1"
    ],
    "start_sec": 211.49,
    "end_sec": 211.49,
    "start_time": "03:31.490",
    "end_time": "03:31.490",
    "duration_sec": 0.0,
    "text": "Okay",
    "word_start_index": 624,
    "word_end_index": 624
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "seg_0069",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_1",
    "raw_elevenlabs_speaker_ids": [
      "speaker_0"
    ],
    "start_sec": 211.49,
    "end_sec": 212.22,
    "start_time": "03:31.490",
    "end_time": "03:32.220",
    "duration_sec": 0.73,
    "text": "... to see how it goes down.",
    "word_start_index": 625,
    "word_end_index": 631
  }
]